,\"15\":{\"fill\":\"#980000\",\"fontSize\":\"20\",\"fontFamily\":\"courier\"},\"16\":{\"fill\":\"#980000\",\"fontSize\":\"20\",\"fontFamily\":\"courier\"},\"17\":{\"fill\":\"#980000\",\"fontSize\":\"20\",\"fontFamily\":\"courier\"},\"18\":{\"fill\":\"#980000\",\"fontSize\":\"20\",\"fontFamily\":\"courier\"},\"19\":{\"fill\":\"#980000\",\"fontSize\":\"20\",\"fontFamily\":\"courier\"},\"20\":{\"fill\":\"#980000\",\"fontSize\":\"20\",\"fontFamily\":\"courier\"},\"21\":{\"fill\":\"#980000\",\"fontSize\":\"20\",\"fontFamily\":\"courier\"},\"22\":{\"fill\":\"#980000\",\"fontFamily\":\"courier\",\"fontSize\":\"20\",\"fontWeight\":\"normal\",\"fontStyle\":\"\"},\"23\":{}}}}"}}}},"file":"/content/assets/7c970d0f9e6d7823475e.svg"}],"selected_canvas":0,"keys":[0],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"786f51ae0ef311ecba283af9d3c2d1d5","text":"下面代码中，已经实现了对二叉搜索树`BST`的中序遍历实现：","text_html":"<p>下面代码中，已经实现了对二叉搜索树<code>BST</code>的中序遍历实现：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"786f51e00ef311ecba283af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"class Node(object):\n  def __init__(self, data):\n    self.data = data\n    self.left = None\n    self.right = None\n\n\nclass BST(object):\n    def __init__(self, root):\n        self.root = Node(root)\n\n    def insert(self, data):\n        if self.root is None:\n            self.root = Node(data)\n        else:\n            self._insert(data, self.root)\n\n    def _insert(self, data, cur_node):\n        if data < cur_node.data:\n            if cur_node.left is None:\n                cur_node.left = Node(data)\n            else:\n                self._insert(data, cur_node.left)\n\n        elif data > cur_node.data:\n            if cur_node.right is None:\n                cur_node.right = Node(data)\n            else:\n                self._insert(data, cur_node.right)\n        else:\n            print(\"Value already in tree!\")\n\n    def inorder_print_tree(self):\n        if self.root:\n            self._inorder_print_tree(self.root)\n\n    def _inorder_print_tree(self, cur_node):\n        if cur_node:\n            self._inorder_print_tree(cur_node.left)\n            print(str(cur_node.data))\n            self._inorder_print_tree(cur_node.right)\n\n    def find(self, data):\n        if self.root:\n            is_found = self._find(data, self.root)\n            if is_found:\n                return True\n            return False\n        else:\n            return None\n\n    def _find(self, data, cur_node):\n        if data > cur_node.data and cur_node.right:\n            return self._find(data, cur_node.right)\n        elif data < cur_node.data and cur_node.left:\n            return self._find(data, cur_node.left)\n        if data == cur_node.data:\n            return True\n\nbst = BST(7)\nbst.insert(3)\nbst.insert(10)\nbst.insert(5)\nbst.insert(1)\nbst.insert(8)\nbst.insert(9)\nbst.insert(2)\n\nbst.inorder_print_tree()            ","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"786f52080ef311ecba283af9d3c2d1d5","text":"上面讨论了中序遍历，可以使用类似的想法来检查一棵树是否满足`BST`属性。如果我们中序遍历一棵二叉树，并得到一个排序的列表，那么该树就满足BST属性。\n\n## 编码\n\n现在讨论一下上一课挑战的解决方案：","text_html":"<p>上面讨论了中序遍历，可以使用类似的想法来检查一棵树是否满足<code>BST</code>属性。如果我们中序遍历一棵二叉树，并得到一个排序的列表，那么该树就满足BST属性。</p>\n<h2>编码</h2>\n<p>现在讨论一下上一课挑战的解决方案：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":4},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"786f523a0ef311ecba283af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"def is_bst_satisfied(self):\n    def helper(node, lower=float('-inf'), upper=float('inf')):\n        if not node:\n            return True\n        \n        val = node.data\n        if val <= lower or val >= upper:\n            return False\n\n        if not helper(node.right, val, upper):\n            return False\n        if not helper(node.left, lower, val):\n            return False\n        return True\n\n    return helper(self.root)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"7\n10\n12\n16","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"786f52620ef311ecba283af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 解释\n\n在`is_bst_satisfied`方法中在**第2**行定义了一个内部方法`helper`，它接受`node`、`lower`和 `upper`作为输入参数。**第3行**，处理结点`node`为空的情况。如果`node`是`None`，则**第4行**返回`True`。否则，执行到**第6行**，在那里`val`被变成等于`node.data`。\n\n接下来，在**第7行**检查条件`val <= lower or val >= upper`。如果这两个条件中的任何一个是`True`，那么在**第8行**的方法中就会返回`False`。这是因为当前节点的值应该大于左子树中所有子节点的值，并且应该小于右子树中所有子节点的值。\n\n现在已经检查了当前节点的`BST`属性，现在是检查子树的时候了。在**第10**行，我们对当前节点的右子树进行递归调用。`node.right`被传递为`node`，`val`被传递为`lower`，而`upper`保持不变。`lower`现在是右子树的下限，因为右子树的所有子节点必须大于当前节点的值。如果递归调用返回`False`，**第10行**的条件将为`True`，并从该方法返回`False`。\n\n同样地，左子树通过**第12行**的递归调用进行检查。现在`val`作为`upper`传递给递归调用，因为左子树的所有子节点必须小于当前节点的值。\n\n如果**第14行**之前的条件都没有为`True`，则在**第14行**返回 `True`，表示`BST`属性被满足。\n\n你可以运行下面的代码，在这里我们有本章讨论的`BST`类的全部实现：","text_html":"<h2>解释</h2>\n<p>在<code>is_bst_satisfied</code>方法中在<strong>第2</strong>行定义了一个内部方法<code>helper</code>，它接受<code>node</code>、<code>lower</code>和 <code>upper</code>作为输入参数。<strong>第3行</strong>，处理结点<code>node</code>为空的情况。如果<code>node</code>是<code>None</code>，则<strong>第4行</strong>返回<code>True</code>。否则，执行到<strong>第6行</strong>，在那里<code>val</code>被变成等于<code>node.data</code>。</p>\n<p>接下来，在<strong>第7行</strong>检查条件<code>val &lt;= lower or val &gt;= upper</code>。如果这两个条件中的任何一个是<code>True</code>，那么在<strong>第8行</strong>的方法中就会返回<code>False</code>。这是因为当前节点的值应该大于左子树中所有子节点的值，并且应该小于右子树中所有子节点的值。</p>\n<p>现在已经检查了当前节点的<code>BST</code>属性，现在是检查子树的时候了。在<strong>第10</strong>行，我们对当前节点的右子树进行递归调用。<code>node.right</code>被传递为<code>node</code>，<code>val</code>被传递为<code>lower</code>，而<code>upper</code>保持不变。<code>lower</code>现在是右子树的下限，因为右子树的所有子节点必须大于当前节点的值。如果递归调用返回<code>False</code>，<strong>第10行</strong>的条件将为<code>True</code>，并从该方法返回<code>False</code>。</p>\n<p>同样地，左子树通过<strong>第12行</strong>的递归调用进行检查。现在<code>val</code>作为<code>upper</code>传递给递归调用，因为左子树的所有子节点必须小于当前节点的值。</p>\n<p>如果<strong>第14行</strong>之前的条件都没有为<code>True</code>，则在<strong>第14行</strong>返回 <code>True</code>，表示<code>BST</code>属性被满足。</p>\n<p>你可以运行下面的代码，在这里我们有本章讨论的<code>BST</code>类的全部实现：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":6},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"786f528a0ef311ecba283af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"class Node(object):\n  def __init__(self, data):\n    self.data = data\n    self.left = None\n    self.right = None\n\n\nclass BST(object):\n    def __init__(self, root):\n        self.root = Node(root)\n\n    def insert(self, data):\n        if self.root is None:\n            self.root = Node(data)\n        else:\n            self._insert(data, self.root)\n\n    def _insert(self, data, cur_node):\n        if data < cur_node.data:\n            if cur_node.left is None:\n                cur_node.left = Node(data)\n            else:\n                self._insert(data, cur_node.left)\n\n        elif data > cur_node.data:\n            if cur_node.right is None:\n                cur_node.right = Node(data)\n            else:\n                self._insert(data, cur_node.right)\n        else:\n            print(\"Value already in tree!\")\n\n    def inorder_print_tree(self):\n        if self.root:\n            self._inorder_print_tree(self.root)\n\n    def _inorder_print_tree(self, cur_node):\n        if cur_node:\n            self._inorder_print_tree(cur_node.left)\n            print(str(cur_node.data))\n            self._inorder_print_tree(cur_node.right)\n\n    def find(self, data):\n        if self.root:\n            is_found = self._find(data, self.root)\n            if is_found:\n                return True\n            return False\n        else:\n            return None\n\n    def _find(self, data, cur_node):\n        if data > cur_node.data and cur_node.right:\n            return self._find(data, cur_node.right)\n        elif data < cur_node.data and cur_node.left:\n            return self._find(data, cur_node.left)\n        if data == cur_node.data:\n            return True\n\n    def is_bst_satisfied(self):\n        def helper(node, lower=float('-inf'), upper=float('inf')):\n            if not node:\n                return True\n            \n            val = node.data\n            if val <= lower or val >= upper:\n                return False\n\n            if not helper(node.right, val, upper):\n                return False\n            if not helper(node.left, lower, val):\n                return False\n            return True\n\n        return helper(self.root) \n\nbst = BST(4)\nbst.insert(2)\nbst.insert(8)\nbst.insert(5)\nbst.insert(10)\n\ntree = BST(1)\ntree.root.left = Node(2)\ntree.root.right = Node(3)\ntree.root.left.left = Node(4)\ntree.root.left.right = Node(5)\ntree.root.right.left = Node(6)\ntree.root.right.right = Node(7)\ntree.root.right.right.right = Node(8)\n\nprint(bst.is_bst_satisfied())\nprint(tree.is_bst_satisfied())","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"60 75","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":7},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"786f52b20ef311ecba283af9d3c2d1d5","text":"恭喜你！已经完成了数据结构部分的课程。\n\n现在，在剩下的课程中我们将专注于算法。希望你能够享受到学习数据结构的乐趣!","text_html":"<p>恭喜你！已经完成了数据结构部分的课程。</p>\n<p>现在，在剩下的课程中我们将专注于算法。希望你能够享受到学习数据结构的乐趣!</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":8}],"status":"undo","course_no":"004","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/004/page/174"}
